  ('What is the tone of the passage?', 'Reflective and bittersweet', ['Angry and bitter', 'Silly and light', 'Cold and scientific'], 'The narrator broods on hope that keeps slipping away.'),
  ('Why does the sentence “tomorrow we will run faster, stretch out our arms further …” break off?', 'It shows hope that is never finished or fulfilled', ['The page was torn', 'The narrator fell asleep', 'The narrator is interrupted by Gatsby'], 'Like the dream, the sentence trails off unfinished.'),
